What: /sys/bus/platform/devices/alarmtimer.*/alarm_events
Date: November 2026
Contact: Q2 Navidrome developers
Description:
 Read-only version1 joint snapshot of REALTIME/BOOTTIME alarm expiry counts,
 pending-due flags, overflow and guarded (wakeup-count event guard available).
 The fixed REALTIME then BOOTTIME lock order makes the snapshot joint. Counts
 advance before fd callbacks, and each expiry emits a zero-duration wake event
 so a late user alarm races the final wakeup_count handshake rather than being
 silently re-slept. Counters saturate; unknown/overflow/unguarded evidence must
 not be called maintenance-only. Timer identities/deadlines/data are not exposed.
 Existing RTC timerqueue ordering and user alarm programming are unchanged.
